---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const { lang = "en", noindex = false } = Astro.props;
---

<Layout
    title="About SaveTikFast – Independent TikTok Media Utility & Guides"
    description="Learn how SaveTikFast works, our editorial standards, privacy architecture, and our commitment to respectful use of public TikTok content."
    lang={lang}
    noindex={noindex}
    pageType="page"
>
    <section class="page-header">
        <div class="container"><h1>About SaveTikFast</h1></div>
    </section>

    <main class="content-section">
        <article class="text-content">
            <p class="intro">SaveTikFast is an independent browser utility and educational resource built for creators, editors, and everyday users who want to organize references from public TikTok links cleanly and securely.</p>

            <h2>What we do</h2>
            <p>Our service processes a public link supplied by a visitor and returns the available media streams (MP4 video, MP3 audio, or carousel images) for that request. Visitors never need to create an account, install browser extensions, or share social login credentials to use our tools. Available formats and resolutions depend on the original public post and platform delivery.</p>

            <h2>Creator utilities &amp; browser-side privacy</h2>
            <p>Alongside link processing, SaveTikFast offers a suite of client-side creator utilities — including image compression, format conversion (WebP, PNG, JPG), QR code generation, engagement diagnostics, and caption formatting — that execute locally inside your web browser without uploading personal files to remote storage.</p>

            <h2>Respect for creators and rights holders</h2>
            <p>SaveTikFast is intended for personal offline viewing, accessibility, research, and content that a visitor owns or has explicit permission to archive. A public URL does not automatically grant commercial redistribution rights. Visitors are responsible for respecting creator permissions, platform terms, and applicable copyright law.</p>
            <p>We do not host or archive third-party videos, audio tracks, or user profiles on our servers, and we maintain a dedicated <a href="/dmca">DMCA Takedown Policy</a> for copyright owners.</p>

            <h2>Privacy, security &amp; sustainable operation</h2>
            <p>SaveTikFast runs over encrypted HTTPS edge infrastructure powered by Cloudflare Workers. Links submitted into the downloader are processed transiently in memory to fulfill your request. To keep SaveTikFast free for everyone worldwide without paywalls or subscriptions, indexable tool and guide pages are supported by clearly separated display advertising governed by our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial Policy</a>.</p>

            <h2>Contact and feedback</h2>
            <p>Questions, bug reports, correction requests, and rights-holder inquiries are welcome via our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> or directly by email at <a href="mailto:support@savetik-fast.xyz">support@savetik-fast.xyz</a>. We review all support messages within 24 hours and prioritize copyright notices within 12 hours.</p>
        </article>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
    .page-header { background: var(--surface); padding: 3.5rem 1.25rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 800; margin: 0; }
    .content-section { padding: 3.5rem 20px; }
    .text-content { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-main); background: var(--glass); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
    :global([data-theme="light"]) .text-content { background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05); }
    .intro { font-size: 1.18rem; color: var(--text-dim); }
    h2 { font-size: 1.55rem; margin: 2.2rem 0 0.9rem; color: var(--secondary); }
    p { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
    a { color: var(--secondary); }
</style>
